		"name": "EMS Backend API Collection",
		"description": "Complete API Collection for Employee Management System (EMS) Backend built with Django REST Framework.\n\n### Authentication\nThis collection uses JWT Bearer Token authentication. \n1. Register a user or Login with existing credentials.\n2. The **Login** request automatically sets the `access_token` and `refresh_token` environment variables.\n3. Requests in the **Company Management** folder inherit the Bearer Token authentication automatically.",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
